   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_00ba4596d5c77b00183d",
   "sourceHash": "00ba4596d5c77b00183db6d15a4e15847aeae8dd7b87222ccbf7b15c5a32bd78",
   "text": "该方案是否适合颈椎病患者或曾接受过颈部手术的患者？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4b6c59d7ddfc3cdaa5ef",
   "sourceHash": "4b6c59d7ddfc3cdaa5ef9a7d941fe10df36c7f88dc9159446df2ee77d8baefb3",
   "text": "在考虑任何疗法之前，请先告知您的诊断以及外科或专科医生的建议，并询问哪些操作和活动适合您的颈部状况。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_277142704885f9cce6eb",
